# Local Claude Code state is machine-specific. Shared skills are the exception:
# they describe this project's workflow and belong under review like any other
# instruction file.
#
# Note the patterns below are anchored to the repo root — unlike the bare
# `.claude/` they replaced, they do not match nested copies. Any nested one is
# agent scratch state and is listed explicitly.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
backend/.claude/

